Game Programer
Makes the game functional and real
Subcategories
AI Programer
Creates algorithms to create the behaviors of other entities(Ex. Enemy movement, camera control, pathfinding, etc.)
Gameplay Engineer
Create evaluation code, math, UI events, player notifications, refine software tools, etc.


Game Designer
Comes up with the ideas for the games
Subcategories
Systems Designer
Identify what is required to build the game and manage the performance of the game
Level Designer
Creates the levels to be intuitively able to be played and beaten by the player without messing up the games feel



Game Artist
Makes the visual assets
Subcategories
3-D Character Artist
Creates the 3-D models based off of the concept art
Environment Artist
Builds the environment of the game and makes sure the area fits the design of the world



Game Production Manager
Makes sure every other team is on time and that everything works properly



Sound Designers
Makes all audio for the game
